OL,3,GNEWSANew coastal cancer screenings aim
OL,4,Ato save lives
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new lung-screening programme could
OL,7,Fsave lives by targeting deprived
OL,8,Fcoastal areas, according to health
OL,9,Fbosses.
OL,11,FA mobile testing unit, including a CT
OL,12,Fscanner, has opened in Mablethorpe,
OL,13,FLincolnshire, with the hope of finding
OL,14,Fand treating the condition at an early
OL,15,Fstage.
OL,17,FStuart Martin, 73, from Sutton on Sea
OL,18,Fsaid he smoked for about 20 years and
OL,19,Fdecided to attend a screening "to be
OL,20,Faware".
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
