OL,3,GNEWSANew coastal cancer screenings aim
OL,4,Ato save lives
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Some people don't want to know what's
OL,7,Fwrong with them, but I think sometimes
OL,8,Fif you know, you can prepare yourself
OL,9,For get treatments," he said.
